# App conventions

- All npm commands run from `app/`.
- Frontend: TypeScript, React 19, Mantine, React Router under `app/src/`.
- Backend/parser: CommonJS JavaScript in `server.js`, `src/parser/`, `utilities/`.
- Do not move `app/` to repo root (Heroku subtree deploy).

Match existing style in each folder. See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for commands and workflow.
